  "worked_solution": "| $x$ | **$-3$** | **$-2$** | **$-1$** | **$0$** | **$1$** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | $-8$ | $-4$ | $2$ | $6$ | $10$ |\n\nThe coefficients of the line that best fits the data can be found as the least-squares solution $\\overset{^}{\\beta }$ to the system \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{X}{\\overset{\u23de}{[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]}}\\overset{\\beta }{\\overset{\u23de}{[\\begin{aligned}{\\beta }_{0} \\\\ {\\beta }_{1}\\end{aligned}]}} & =\\overset{y}{\\overset{\u23de}{[\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 10\\end{aligned}]}},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $X$ is the design matrix, $\\beta $ is the parameter vector, and $y$ is the observation vector.",
